ok - an appended line produces a delta with exact offsets, hashes, and payload
ok - an unchanged log costs one stat per poll and exits 75 at the window
ok - the capture and hashing path runs exactly once a real change lands
ok - a shrunk log breaks continuity as truncated with the remaining hash
